## ISSUES ENCOUNTERED AND RESOLVED

Issue 1: Faker en_ZA locale invalid in Faker 25.x
  Error: AttributeError: Invalid configuration for faker locale 'en_ZA'
  Fix:   Changed Faker("en_ZA") to Faker("en_GB") in both affected producers
  Commit: fix(producers): replace en_ZA Faker locale with en_GB

Issue 2: Flink Containerfile DNS failure (Maven JARs)
  Error: dial tcp: lookup repo1.maven.org: Temporary failure in name resolution
  Root:  ADD <https://...> resolves DNS at build time on WSL host layer,
         which lacks proper DNS in Podman Desktop WSL environment
  Fix:   Replaced all ADD <url> with RUN wget inside container layer
  Commit: fix(build): replace ADD with RUN wget in Flink Containerfile

Issue 3: podman compose --profile producers up -d --build timed out
  Root:  podman-compose rebuilds ALL services in the profile list,
         including Flink image (large download). Separate build step needed.
  Fix:   Build producer image once with 'podman build', then start containers
         with 'podman run' directly. Makefile producers-up target updated.

